WEBVTT

00:42.020 --> 00:44.520
<b>Kitami Station</b>

00:44.890 --> 00:49.440
<b>Episode 11:
Youth Hits Super Hard in the Feels</b>

00:44.890 --> 00:49.440
<b>Episode 11:
Youth Hits Super Hard in the Feels</b>

00:47.230 --> 00:49.730
<i>I couldn't sleep! At all!</i>

00:50.120 --> 00:51.740
I have something that I want to tell you.

00:53.640 --> 00:57.610
<i>What could Fuyuki-san want 
to tell me? I wonder.</i>

00:58.870 --> 01:01.580
<i>No way... a love confes—?!</i>

01:00.350 --> 01:01.790
<b>Confession</b>

01:01.580 --> 01:04.610
<i>No, no, impossible! There's no way.</i>

01:05.900 --> 01:06.770
<i>But...</i>

01:08.510 --> 01:11.090
<i>I'm still really nervous about it.</i>

01:17.720 --> 01:19.090
Okay, see you later.

01:20.260 --> 01:22.890
If anything happens, just call me, okay?

01:22.890 --> 01:24.250
Got it.

01:24.250 --> 01:25.020
Mii?

01:27.790 --> 01:30.970
You're looking super adorable today, Mii!

01:37.710 --> 01:38.680
Fight!

01:44.540 --> 01:48.440
I'm sorry! I realize this is 
a super early time to meet.

01:48.440 --> 01:50.810
No, it's totally okay.

01:51.160 --> 01:54.170
<i>And since I couldn't sleep, 
earlier is better!</i>

01:54.170 --> 01:56.490
The place I want to take 
you is pretty far away.

01:56.490 --> 02:00.700
That's right. You didn't tell me where 
we're going. How long is it going to take?

02:00.700 --> 02:03.040
Hmm... about three hours?

02:03.040 --> 02:04.010
Three?!

02:04.010 --> 02:06.810
<i>If you took a train 
for three hours from Tokyo,</i>

02:04.010 --> 02:09.770
<b>Kitami Station</b>

02:06.810 --> 02:09.150
<i>you could cross the whole prefecture!</i>

02:09.770 --> 02:12.250
We won't notice the time 
passing by if we're chatting.

02:12.250 --> 02:17.010
Also, it's a place that I think 
you're really gonna like,

02:17.010 --> 02:18.970
so go ahead and get your hopes up.

02:20.130 --> 02:22.130
But it's a secret until we arrive!

02:23.090 --> 02:24.730
I'm looking forward to it!

02:33.870 --> 02:36.520
Look, Fuyuki-san! There are horses out there!

02:42.310 --> 02:44.020
<i>She fell asleep.</i>

02:45.180 --> 02:50.190
<i>Now that I think of it, the same 
thing happened right after I met her.</i>

02:50.820 --> 02:53.160
<i>I sure wasn't expecting </i>that<i>.</i>

02:56.740 --> 02:59.960
<i>We've gone through a lot since then.</i>

03:00.500 --> 03:03.570
<i>And I've only lived in 
Hokkaido for a few months!</i>

03:04.300 --> 03:07.730
<i>It already feels like we've known 
each other for a really long time.</i>

03:08.080 --> 03:12.250
<i>Fuyuki-san has definitely 
influenced me in a lot of ways.</i>

03:12.630 --> 03:18.840
<i>But I wonder if I've 
given anything back.</i>

03:24.500 --> 03:26.340
Tsuba-cha?

03:30.870 --> 03:31.960
So pretty.

03:34.480 --> 03:36.400
Huh? No, wait!

03:36.400 --> 03:38.550
I mean, the light was hitting you just right,

03:38.550 --> 03:40.840
like you were sparkling and it looked pretty!

03:40.840 --> 03:43.320
Wait! Is that even worse?

03:47.050 --> 03:48.830
You're so wacky.

03:52.040 --> 03:54.040
<i>Thank you for riding with us today.</i>

03:54.380 --> 03:57.460
<i>We will soon reach our final 
destination, Abashiri. Abashiri.</i>

03:56.470 --> 03:57.800
We're almost there!

03:57.800 --> 04:01.550
<b>Okhotsk</b>

03:58.250 --> 04:01.550
Next we ride the bus, but before that...

04:01.550 --> 04:08.060
Abashiri Station

04:01.550 --> 04:08.060
<b>m 0 0 l 60 0 l 60 40 l 0 40</b>

04:01.550 --> 04:08.060
<b>Abashiri
Station</b>

04:02.550 --> 04:04.630
So, Tsubasa, are you hungry?

04:05.430 --> 04:08.060
Huh? Uh, yeah. I guess so.

04:08.060 --> 04:10.610
M'kay, then let's take a little detour.

04:08.060 --> 04:11.390
Rent-a-Cycle

04:12.450 --> 04:14.310
The breeze feels so good!

04:14.800 --> 04:18.820
It would have taken a while to 
walk, so we really lucked out!

04:18.820 --> 04:21.830
<i>I never thought we'd be 
biking all the way out here.</i>

04:22.690 --> 04:23.720
<i>But...</i>

04:24.570 --> 04:26.520
Tsubasa, hurry up!

04:26.520 --> 04:27.410
Okay!

04:37.020 --> 04:38.920
Thank you for the food!

04:45.110 --> 04:48.220
The sugar really hits you after exercising!

04:48.220 --> 04:52.560
The outside crust is all crispy, 
and the bean paste inside is exquisite!

04:52.560 --> 04:55.590
Yeah! Hokkaido's bean paste is the best!

04:55.590 --> 04:58.860
And of course you'd know 
all about it, Fuyuki-san!

04:59.260 --> 05:01.400
Well, actually that's what Dad told me.

05:06.950 --> 05:08.950
I-Is something wrong?

05:08.950 --> 05:10.410
<i>She's staring.</i>

05:10.410 --> 05:11.240
Well,

05:11.910 --> 05:15.390
you always look so happy when you're eating.

05:15.390 --> 05:18.750
I mean, when I watch you, 
it makes me happy, too.

05:19.000 --> 05:21.140
So I just never want to stop.

05:24.930 --> 05:27.510
Aww, why'd you have to look away?

05:27.810 --> 05:30.600
<i>Is she teasing me? Or saying it for real?</i>

05:31.950 --> 05:33.770
<i>Fine, then. My turn.</i>

05:34.020 --> 05:38.870
W-Well, you also make food 
look very delicious, Fuyuki-san.

05:38.870 --> 05:40.470
It makes me envious.

05:41.380 --> 05:42.400
No, I mean it.

05:46.270 --> 05:49.210
C'mon then Tsuba-cha, turn this way.

05:49.210 --> 05:51.450
I'll let you have a bite of my cream one.

05:52.670 --> 05:53.970
Say "ahh."

05:55.350 --> 05:57.670
A-Ahh.

05:59.270 --> 06:00.230
Tasty?

06:00.710 --> 06:02.130
Mm-hmm.

06:02.130 --> 06:05.970
<i>Fuyuki-san is coming on so strong today!</i>

06:09.220 --> 06:13.010
Hey, Tsubasa. Between this one and 
this one, which do you like better?

06:13.780 --> 06:20.060
Hmm. They both look good on you, but I 
think this one matches your style better.

06:20.710 --> 06:24.000
M'kay, then I'll go buy it.

06:24.000 --> 06:25.430
Just like that?

07:01.240 --> 07:03.360
You really can't see anything, right?

07:03.360 --> 07:05.480
I really can't!

07:05.740 --> 07:09.270
<i>I didn't expect to be blindfolded 
until the last minute!</i>

07:09.270 --> 07:11.360
<i>She really is going all out.</i>

07:11.360 --> 07:12.450
<i>Also,</i>

07:12.720 --> 07:14.740
<i>something is touching my back!!</i>

07:16.170 --> 07:19.630
M'kay, I'm taking my hands off 
so keep your eyes closed, okay?

07:19.630 --> 07:21.500
Ah, all right.

07:24.750 --> 07:26.040
You can open them now.

07:26.710 --> 07:28.460
<i>What could this be?</i>

07:39.060 --> 07:42.450
We're at Higashimokoto Shibazakura Park.

07:43.060 --> 07:46.360
<b>Higashimokoto Shibazakura Park</b>

07:46.360 --> 07:49.440
You said you wanted to see cherry blossoms,

07:49.440 --> 07:53.530
so I decided to show you another 
kind of blossom that Hokkaido has!

07:57.960 --> 07:59.040
<i>That's right!</i>

07:59.860 --> 08:03.090
I do want to see Hokkaido's 
cherry blossoms soon, though.

08:08.940 --> 08:11.400
Huh? Tsubasa, what's wrong?

08:11.730 --> 08:14.180
Oh, maybe you weren't really that interested?

08:18.070 --> 08:20.350
This is amazing, Fuyuki-san!

08:20.770 --> 08:23.710
I've never seen blossoms 
this beautiful before.

08:25.740 --> 08:30.470
Hokkaido was covered in white all this time, 
but now it's like it's painted in color.

08:30.810 --> 08:36.320
I don't know if I can really describe it, 
but I'm so moved right now!

08:39.580 --> 08:43.770
Yes! The surprise is a big success!

08:43.770 --> 08:44.440
But I still...

08:44.440 --> 08:45.830
M'kay! Tsubasa, come on!

08:46.130 --> 08:47.100
Let's go!

08:51.410 --> 08:52.230
Yeah.

08:53.340 --> 08:57.180
<i>Why did she set up such an 
incredible surprise for me?</i>

08:58.690 --> 09:00.930
<i>I wanted to ask, but I didn't.</i>

09:01.750 --> 09:05.270
<i>It seemed like she was 
having such a good time.</i>

09:05.270 --> 09:07.580
<i>I didn't want to ruin the experience.</i>

09:13.650 --> 09:15.280
<b>Yamatsumi Shrine</b>

09:18.740 --> 09:21.860
See? Isn't Higashimokoto 
really grammable?

09:21.860 --> 09:24.700
Everything you shoot comes 
out looking perfect!

09:25.610 --> 09:28.330
It's like being inside a fantasy film.

09:29.450 --> 09:31.810
It's even more amazing viewed from above.

09:31.810 --> 09:34.330
I could take picture after picture!

09:34.910 --> 09:39.050
I've only been here once before, 
a long time ago with my family.

09:39.050 --> 09:40.370
Oh, really?

09:40.370 --> 09:44.340
It all came back to me when you 
said you wanted to see blossoms.

09:44.670 --> 09:49.060
When I came before, it didn't really 
give me the feels, you know,

09:49.060 --> 09:52.030
but this time it's totally 
hitting me in the feels!

09:53.510 --> 09:54.520
I bet...

09:55.540 --> 10:00.140
years and years from now, the scenery 
here would look very different to us.

10:02.430 --> 10:04.440
Even if the park doesn't change at all.

10:08.740 --> 10:11.630
And by then, you'd be an old geezer!

10:13.400 --> 10:15.060
You realize we're the same age, right?

10:15.060 --> 10:19.080
I'll take such good care of myself that 
I'll transform into one hot momma!

10:19.850 --> 10:21.020
<i>I bet she will!</i>

10:21.020 --> 10:23.310
<i>Her mom is really pretty, too, after all.</i>

10:21.260 --> 10:23.310
What a beaut!

10:26.070 --> 10:28.420
Hey, Tsubasa. Let's get a picture together!

10:30.400 --> 10:32.790
All right, I'm taking it now!

10:32.790 --> 10:34.780
A skosh to the left, left.

10:34.780 --> 10:35.650
This way?

10:35.650 --> 10:37.370
Ah, no, your other left.

10:37.370 --> 10:38.670
This side, then?

10:38.670 --> 10:41.130
All right then, here we go!

10:41.130 --> 10:43.180
Say cheese!

10:43.280 --> 10:45.910
<b>Yamatsumi Shrine</b>

10:45.910 --> 10:48.670
Thank you for taking our picture!

10:48.670 --> 10:50.280
Thank you!

10:50.860 --> 10:53.620
I'll send you the picture later, okay?

10:53.620 --> 10:55.460
Yeah! Thanks!

10:55.460 --> 10:59.970
<b>Yamatsumi Shrine</b>

10:56.520 --> 10:59.650
This really is amazing when 
you stop to think about it.

11:00.370 --> 11:01.960
A shrine on the top of a hill.

11:01.960 --> 11:06.050
They say it grants a kind of fortune 
that makes it really popular with women.

11:06.520 --> 11:08.600
Oh? What kind?

11:10.130 --> 11:11.310
Fertility.

11:11.310 --> 11:12.270
Fer—?!

11:13.450 --> 11:15.860
Your face is so red! Hilarious!

11:17.690 --> 11:20.230
Let's come back then, 
years and years from now.

11:20.230 --> 11:21.260
Yeah.

11:21.860 --> 11:22.660
Huh?

11:22.660 --> 11:26.620
And then we can take another picture 
together in front of the shrine.

11:27.380 --> 11:28.660
'Cause you know...

11:32.130 --> 11:33.740
wouldn't that give you major feels?

11:36.390 --> 11:37.640
I guess so.

11:38.250 --> 11:40.540
If we do come back, major feels.

11:43.890 --> 11:48.260
<i>What exactly did she mean by that?</i>

11:48.260 --> 11:50.450
Since we're here, let's pay our respects!

11:51.780 --> 11:55.110
<i>It might not mean anything deep at all.</i>

11:55.340 --> 11:58.060
<i>Still, I couldn't help but wonder.</i>

11:58.860 --> 12:04.450
<i>If we're still together as adults, 
would we be "friends" like we are now?</i>

12:06.510 --> 12:07.700
<i>Or something else?</i>

12:13.370 --> 12:15.880
Natsukawa

12:15.880 --> 12:18.380
<b>Tohoku Un</b>

12:15.880 --> 12:18.380
<b>Liberal A</b>

12:15.880 --> 12:18.380
<b>Trends and Strategies</b>

12:15.880 --> 12:18.380
<b>Common Test</b>

12:15.880 --> 12:18.380
<b>Trends and Strategies</b>

12:15.880 --> 12:18.380
<b>Mathematics</b>

12:15.880 --> 12:18.380
<b>College Entrance Exam Strategies</b>

12:15.880 --> 12:18.380
<b>Hokkaido University</b>

12:15.880 --> 12:18.380
<b>Liberal Arts</b>

12:15.880 --> 12:18.380
<b>College Entra</b>

12:24.580 --> 12:26.390
thirty-five minutes?

12:27.210 --> 12:29.850
I still need to shave five minutes off.

12:33.560 --> 12:36.820
I wonder what Shiki-kun is doing right now.

12:39.270 --> 12:43.480
Rena-san, I'm off to do some shopping.

12:43.480 --> 12:45.000
All right!

12:53.330 --> 12:56.110
Brainy!

12:56.110 --> 12:58.250
Hey, that tickles!

12:58.660 --> 13:02.360
Ah, stop! Stop! Brain-chan!

13:06.470 --> 13:07.430
Yes?

13:07.650 --> 13:09.260
Hello, Rena-chan!

13:09.260 --> 13:12.250
I brought the neighborhood 
bulletin. Do you mind?

13:12.250 --> 13:14.990
Not at all. Thank you very much!

13:14.990 --> 13:16.390
Take care!

13:29.000 --> 13:30.060
Coming!

13:31.070 --> 13:34.230
<i>Does Shiki-kun have a sore throat?</i>

13:34.230 --> 13:36.120
<i>His voice sounds different.</i>

13:37.810 --> 13:39.460
Hello, Shiki-kun...

13:40.050 --> 13:42.340
Hmm? May I ask who you are?

13:43.060 --> 13:44.760
U-Um...

13:44.760 --> 13:46.840
Oh, one of Tsubasa's friends?

13:47.210 --> 13:50.630
I'm really sorry, but he's out right now.

13:59.210 --> 13:59.560
So—

13:59.560 --> 14:03.820
Oh! Hey, Tsubasa! I want to ride those!

14:04.230 --> 14:06.130
S-Sounds great.

14:06.130 --> 14:09.750
Tsubasa, don't tell me you've 
never ridden a go-kart before...?

14:09.750 --> 14:10.480
<i>Gulp.</i>

14:10.480 --> 14:12.090
Oh-kay!

14:12.090 --> 14:16.610
When you see my killer driving technique, 
your eyes'll pop out of your head!

15:53.960 --> 15:56.920
Shibazakura soft cream is so yum!

15:56.920 --> 15:59.520
It matches the color of the blossoms here.

15:59.520 --> 16:01.390
Mm-hmm!

16:04.830 --> 16:05.910
Fuyuki-san.

16:05.910 --> 16:06.660
Hmm?

16:07.070 --> 16:08.670
Say cheese.

16:12.320 --> 16:14.150
<i>Photogenic!</i>

16:14.980 --> 16:16.320
You're melting.

16:16.320 --> 16:17.960
Huh? Ah... uh-oh!

16:22.360 --> 16:24.290
That was so good!

16:27.910 --> 16:30.430
M'kay, should we start heading back?

16:30.430 --> 16:31.730
I guess so.

16:31.730 --> 16:34.800
I hate to leave now, 
but the sun is starting to set.

16:37.560 --> 16:38.670
Hey, Tsubasa.

16:39.810 --> 16:42.290
Did you make me look pretty 
in the picture you just took?

16:42.290 --> 16:44.810
Totally! I'll send it to you.

16:46.510 --> 16:47.360
Huh?

16:47.360 --> 17:00.870
<b>Fuyuki Minami</b>

16:47.750 --> 16:48.830
Is this...?

16:48.830 --> 16:52.550
Yeah! The picture we took together. 
I made it my profile picture!

16:52.550 --> 16:54.270
<i>Your profile?!</i>

16:54.270 --> 16:56.170
<i>The picture of us two together?</i>

16:56.170 --> 16:59.820
<i>But doesn't that mean 
other people can see it?</i>

16:59.820 --> 17:03.740
<i>Huh? Aren't people gonna 
think we look like a couple?</i>

17:07.290 --> 17:11.210
<i>Oh, wait. Fuyuki-san might just 
be up to her old tricks again.</i>

17:17.050 --> 17:18.470
Fuyuki-san.

17:19.740 --> 17:23.890
I... wasn't exactly sure 
when to give you this.

17:23.890 --> 17:25.980
Huh? For me?

17:29.940 --> 17:31.320
Can I open it?

17:31.320 --> 17:32.210
Yeah.

17:37.000 --> 17:38.490
A promise bracelet?

17:38.490 --> 17:39.550
Yeah.

17:39.550 --> 17:41.830
I found it in the souvenir shop at the cafe.

17:42.840 --> 17:45.580
I thought it would look good on you.

17:47.560 --> 17:48.790
Hey, Tsubasa.

17:50.820 --> 17:52.000
Put it on me?

18:33.880 --> 18:35.340
I kind of wonder

18:36.020 --> 18:39.010
what other people think 
when they see us together.

18:43.010 --> 18:45.010
<i>What am I supposed to say?</i>

18:45.930 --> 18:47.850
<i>If I said exactly what 
I'm thinking right now,</i>

18:47.850 --> 18:53.220
<i>I'd basically be admitting...</i>

18:55.820 --> 18:56.860
Uh,

18:57.640 --> 19:02.020
I'm sure they think we look 
like two very close friends.

19:09.850 --> 19:13.380
<i>Oh, man. My voice was shaking.</i>

19:14.150 --> 19:18.630
<i>No, wait. What is this? 
Why do I suddenly feel so anxious?</i>

19:19.160 --> 19:21.300
<i>Like I said something I shouldn't?</i>

19:23.820 --> 19:24.840
I guess so.

19:28.020 --> 19:29.250
I guess you're right.

19:36.420 --> 19:37.610
<i>I'm such a coward.</i>

19:41.110 --> 19:44.010
<i>I was too scared to say the important part.</i>

19:45.060 --> 19:46.690
<i>I totally chickened out.</i>

19:47.830 --> 19:51.270
<i>Fuyuki-san was right next to me a minute ago,</i>

19:51.970 --> 19:56.430
<i>but now it feels like 
she's going far, far away.</i>

19:58.180 --> 20:01.420
<i>I can't do this. No. This isn't right.</i>

20:01.860 --> 20:03.900
<i>I need to tell Fuyuki-san.</i>

20:04.940 --> 20:06.670
Fuyuki-san, I—

20:06.670 --> 20:08.260
Tsubasa, listen up.

20:09.780 --> 20:11.810
I'm going away starting next week.

20:17.320 --> 20:20.020
I said I wanted to tell you something, right?

20:20.920 --> 20:22.630
I'm sorry it took me so long.

20:24.230 --> 20:27.110
I'm going to study abroad.

20:31.630 --> 20:34.770
Study... abroad?

20:35.690 --> 20:36.330
Yeah.

20:36.930 --> 20:42.340
I want to work in beauty in the future, 
so I want to start studying for that now.

20:44.430 --> 20:46.460
But this is all thanks to you, Tsubasa!

20:47.510 --> 20:52.850
Before I met you, I was super lazy! 
I just did whatever, you know?

20:52.850 --> 20:56.770
I never really got serious about anything.

20:57.170 --> 21:01.280
But then I met you, living in this brand 
new place, struggling to get along.

21:01.280 --> 21:07.030
Skiing or studying, you always do your best! 
That's how you got so good at piano!

21:07.540 --> 21:10.200
You're always on the level with people,

21:10.200 --> 21:12.040
and you always try to 
understand their feelings.

21:12.300 --> 21:15.340
When you were at the snow festival, 
when you were playing games,

21:16.470 --> 21:21.290
even when we came here today, 
I saw that same sparkle in your eyes.

21:21.290 --> 21:24.550
You're so pure, so straightforward, 
so responsible.

21:24.910 --> 21:26.920
When I see you, I think,

21:29.450 --> 21:32.130
I gotta work harder on myself, too!

21:32.130 --> 21:35.030
I gotta be a better person, too! 
You know what I mean?

21:35.520 --> 21:40.570
So I really wanted to thank you 
for helping me think things over,

21:40.570 --> 21:44.150
and I came up with this idea for a 
surprise on the first day of the term.

21:44.440 --> 21:49.920
But I'm so happy we got to come here 
together before I leave Hokkaido!

21:49.920 --> 21:52.240
I hope you had a lot of fun t—

22:09.300 --> 22:11.710
Tsuba-cha...

22:24.180 --> 22:26.040
Tsubasa?
